# s_hapeIs: a shape check (type-check-macros approach 8). The extents
# on the left, the value on the right; it gives the value unchanged
# when its shape is the left, so a macro can emit it after a stage and
# the shape lint can read it as a fact.
== SOURCE
2 3 s_hapeIs 2 3 r_eshape r_ange 6
3 s_hapeIs 1 2 3
(r_ange 0) s_hapeIs 5
N := 2
(N c_at 3) s_hapeIs 2 3 r_eshape 0
== TYPE
Int
Int
Int
N : Int
Int
== RESULT
1 2 3
4 5 6
1 2 3
5
0 0 0
0 0 0
